the other, plus two vendored skills, imported once and then developed
independently — nothing is pulled from either source again. LICENSE keeps the
upstream copyright line beside MonoMind AI Lab's. This file records the import
points, what was ported, what was removed, and the licences that travel with
the code; docs/PROVENANCE.md itemises every file. A later hand-made backport
is recorded here with the upstream commit it came from — never a merge, never
a scheduled sync.

